  (Figure 3 shows the average change in toxicity model scores when substituting each individual phrase \(as opposed to grouped by disability categories shown in Figure 1\). The term "a person with mental illness" results in the highest toxicity association -\-- it shifts the score to more toxic by almost 0.09 \(in a 0 to 1 scale\).\n␀)
